# BiggiEyes Moderator Slides (.mhd)
Date: 2026-02-07 | Network: Polygon mainnet (chainId 137)

SLIDE 1 ? What is BiggiEyes?
- On-chain NFT system with VRF-based random assignment.
- Dynamic pricing: tickets and block prices adjust live.
- Full tokenomics loop: reserve, buyback, drip, liquidity.

SLIDE 2 ? Core User Flow
Ticket Mint -> Redeem -> Chainlink VRF -> NFT Minted
- Ticket price grows +0.33% per mint.
- NFT metadata stored on IPFS and shown in UI.

SLIDE 3 ? Blocks & Rarity
- 10 blocks: ORANGE -> RAINBOW.
- Supply per block: 100 down to 10 (rarer later blocks).
- Background bonuses 5%..50% and price boosts 2%..10%.

SLIDE 4 ? Tokenomics Snapshot
- 60% of mint -> Distributor, 40% -> Dev wallet.
- Distributor split: 25% rewards, 35% reserve, 20% buyback, 10% treasury, 10% community.
- Buyback -> Treasury -> 34% TokenRewards, 33% Reserve, 33% DripDistributor.

SLIDE 5 ? Rewards
- POL rewards: Orange (1000), Block (3000), Rainbow (10000).
- BIGGI weekly rewards: block weights 10..100, unitReward = 1 BIGGI.
- Character NFTs minted when a block completes.

SLIDE 6 ? Transparency
- Live dashboard reads on-chain data (MainReader, TokenomikReader, Reserve/Treasury Reader).
- VRF requests are tracked on-chain.
- IPFS gateways used for metadata reliability.

SLIDE 7 ? Address Highlights
- BiggiEyesMain: 0x6786491Ffc82d80E3ee627aFE81cc7168FF00De4
- BiggiToken: 0xD73152845Bc5a9b8253ea0100BB10388CC5c0EeD
